### 1. ClamAV on upload routes (P3)

**Status:** Wired — `file-storage-service` scans all uploads when `CLAMAV_ENABLED=true`.

**Production requirements:**

- `CLAMAV_ENABLED=true`, `CLAMAV_HOST` reachable (Docker `clamav` service on port 3310)
- Uploads flow: frontend BFF → `clinic-backend` `/api/files` → `file-storage-service` (scan before persist)
- Patient attachments route through `file-storage-service` internal API (not local disk)

**Key paths:**

- `services/file-storage/src/services/virus-scan.service.ts`
- `services/file-storage/src/utils/file-security.ts`
- `backend/src/modules/files/`
- `docker-compose.dev.yml` → `clamav` + `file-storage-service` env

